    <div>
      <p begin="00:07.671" end="00:09.558" ttm:agent="v1">M-mm, I can't let go</p>
      <p begin="00:09.558" end="00:11.430" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, you really got my soul</p>
      <p begin="00:11.430" end="00:13.489" ttm:agent="v1">M-mm, I can't let go</p>
      <p begin="00:13.489" end="00:15.308" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, you really got my soul</p>
      <p begin="00:15.308" end="00:17.305" ttm:agent="v1">M-mm, I can't let go</p>
      <p begin="00:17.305" end="00:19.132" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, you really got my soul</p>
      <p begin="00:19.132" end="00:21.373" ttm:agent="v1">M-mm, I can't let go</p>
      <p begin="00:21.373" end="00:22.967" ttm:agent="v1">Yes, you really work that pole</p>
      <p begin="00:22.967" end="00:24.890" ttm:agent="v1">Go ahead and get whatcha want</p>
      <p begin="00:24.890" end="00:26.844" ttm:agent="v1">I don't check the price, is not a lot</p>
      <p begin="00:26.844" end="00:28.768" ttm:agent="v1">I buy the b***h what she want</p>
      <p begin="00:28.768" end="00:30.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I don't check the price, is not a lot (Stare)</p>
      <p begin="00:30.730" end="00:32.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Stare (Don't touch it)</p>
