      <p begin="00:36.446" end="00:37.946" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Stare (Don't touch it)</p>
      <p begin="00:37.382" end="00:38.882" ttm:agent="v1">At least I kept it real</p>
      <p begin="00:38.532" end="00:44.608" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah, kept it real, yeah-woo, kept it real, yeah-woo)</p>
      <p begin="00:44.608" end="00:46.108" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Want)</p>
      <p begin="00:45.200" end="00:46.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, kept it real, yeah-woo, yeah, kept it real, yeah-woo)</p>
      <p begin="00:46.507" end="00:48.821" ttm:agent="v1">At least I kept it real</p>
      <p begin="00:48.821" end="00:50.911" ttm:agent="v1">That's something that you gotta do</p>
      <p begin="00:50.911" end="00:52.690" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me how you feel</p>
      <p begin="00:52.690" end="00:54.190" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, okay</p>
      <p begin="00:53.840" end="00:55.686" ttm:agent="v1">I've been runnin', I've been gettin' fake</p>
      <p begin="00:55.686" end="00:57.522" ttm:agent="v1">Surrounded by these girls, I'm feeling joy</p>
      <p begin="00:57.522" end="00:59.503" ttm:agent="v1">They see my name and now they get an eight</p>
      <p begin="00:59.503" end="01:01.436" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'm way too high and Im locked up right now (Stare)</p>
      <p begin="01:01.436" end="01:02.936" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Stare (Don't touch it)</p>
