      <p begin="01:07.195" end="01:08.695" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Stare (Don't touch it)</p>
      <p begin="01:08.112" end="01:09.612" ttm:agent="v1">At least I kept it real</p>
      <p begin="01:09.438" end="01:11.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah, kept it real, yeah-woo, kept it real, yeah-woo)</p>
      <p begin="01:11.830" end="01:13.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(At least I kept it real)</p>
      <p begin="01:13.230" end="01:17.015" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, kept it real, yeah-woo, yeah, kept it real, yeah-woo)</p>
      <p begin="01:17.015" end="01:19.136" ttm:agent="v1">You put all this shit on me</p>
      <p begin="01:19.136" end="01:20.819" ttm:agent="v1">Only go when you lonely</p>
      <p begin="01:20.819" end="01:22.782" ttm:agent="v1">I thought that you were chosen</p>
      <p begin="01:22.782" end="01:24.446" ttm:agent="v1">B*****s see my heart and she froze it all</p>
      <p begin="01:24.446" end="01:26.177" ttm:agent="v1">When I get my shit, I pass 'em a time</p>
      <p begin="01:26.177" end="01:27.731" ttm:agent="v1">Send me to the dark, baby, “I'm sorry not sorry”</p>
      <p begin="01:27.731" end="01:30.104" ttm:agent="v1">I showed you the real and you showed me the fake</p>
      <p begin="01:30.104" end="01:32.113" ttm:agent="v1">What the **** did you think?</p>
      <p begin="01:32.113" end="01:33.613" ttm:agent="v1">Don't touch it</p>
